			"Message": "refactor(Output): Reformat build configuration and plugin pipeline for readability\n\nReformat the entire Output element's ESBuild configuration, plugin definitions, and polyfill scripts to align with the project's PascalCase naming conventions and readability standards. This change follows the previous minification commit by restoring source formatting without altering logical behavior.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Rename minified bindings (e.g., `t` → `Prefix`, `e` → `Current`) and expand dense block structures in `Configuration/ESBuild/CodeEditorLand/Editor.js` and `Bundle.js`.\n- Reformat exclusion patterns (`Configuration/ESBuild/Exclude/` scripts) to include detailed comments explaining the rationale for each excluded path (e.g., `Bootstrap`, `ChromiumIPC`, `Network`, `Telemetry`).\n- Refactor plugin definitions (`Configuration/Plugin/Index.js`) and transform logic (`Configuration/Plugin/Transform/`) to use explicit variable names and multi-line structures for clarity.\n- Update polyfill implementations (`Configuration/Polyfill/` and `Configuration/Service/`) to restore whitespace and indentation.\n- Regenerate source map files (`.js.map`) for all modified configurations to support debugging.\n\nThe logical behavior of the build pipeline remains unchanged; this commit solely addresses source formatting and documentation consistency.",
